BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 571.97 Tm (measured spaces, operating hours, surface, and the proposed monthly rate, then ask whether those particulars solve an) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 556.75 Tm (existing dispatch problem. Avoid invented urgency, guaranteed proceeds, and references to private circumstances) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 541.52 Tm (inferred from public filings. Use business email, individually researched calls, postal letters, and permission-based) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 526.30 Tm (introductions. Maintain suppression across every channel. Commercial email must satisfy 15 U.S.C. 7704, including) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 511.07 Tm (accurate headers, required sender information, and a functioning opt-out. Telephone campaigns must account for 47) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 495.85 Tm (U.S.C. 227 and applicable state restrictions; a published number is not blanket permission for automated texts. Start) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 480.62 Tm (manually so the operator can hear objections before automating a flawed message.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 465.40 Tm (Use six purposeful touches over 21 days, stopping immediately after an opt-out and changing the next step when the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 450.17 Tm (recipient replies. The first message establishes parcel relevance; the second tests whether you reached the right person;) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 434.95 Tm (the third supplies one useful observation or document request. Later touches offer a defined review slot, address the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 419.72 Tm (actual objection, and close the loop. Do not send six versions of an empty follow-up. If an owner says the price is too) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 404.50 Tm (low, show the income, term, buyer multiple, direct costs, and retained spread assumptions; ask which input they) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 389.27 Tm (dispute. If they refuse exclusive control, propose a short, clearly bounded conditional option only where that structure) Tj ET
