BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 349.77 Tm (operating_framework) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 327.55 Tm (Assign the Base team as one full-time principal and three contractor functions: title and transaction counsel,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 312.32 Tm (environmental and civil diligence, and GIS plus bookkeeping operations. Contractor functions describe responsibility,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 297.10 Tm (not a promise that one person holds every professional credential. The principal owns pricing, buyer commitments,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 281.87 Tm (cash exposure, and the weekly exception meeting. Counsel resolves assignment restrictions, brokerage status, recorded) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 266.65 Tm (interests, and closing instruments. The environmental professional controls Phase I scope and findings; the civil) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 251.42 Tm (specialist confirms drainage and access where needed. Operations maintains source snapshots, deadlines, posting) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 236.20 Tm (evidence, and reconciliation. Separate the person preparing a payment instruction from the person independently) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 220.97 Tm (confirming escrow destination details through an established contact channel. Buying or assigning a principal interest) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 205.75 Tm (does not automatically satisfy every state licensing exemption; document the exact local rule and the actual conduct) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 190.52 Tm (performed. When activity is brokerage, engage the required licensee rather than renaming a commission. Contractor) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 175.30 Tm (invoices must reference the deal and work product so that failed diligence remains visible in acquisition cost. Review) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 160.07 Tm (aging weekly by the specific missing instrument and responsible counterparty, not by a vague probability-of-closing) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 144.85 Tm (percentage.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 129.62 Tm (The mapped play property_tax_assessment_appeal_contingency adds a separate, deadline-driven service queue rather) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 114.40 Tm (than magically increasing tower rent. Ingest county valuation rolls when annual notices release, normalize parcel class) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 99.17 Tm (and valuation date, and compare assessed-to-market ratios across genuinely comparable neighbors. An AVM flag starts) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 83.95 Tm (review; it is not proof of unequal assessment or a permitted filing position. For illustration, a supportable $200,000) Tj ET
