BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 685.55 Tm (Across ten successful parcels, that becomes $16,000 before specialist fees and filing costs. The operating range is) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 670.32 Tm (30-50% of the first year's verified reduction, not a percentage of property value or a recurring claim on future savings.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 655.10 Tm (Track the jurisdiction's actual deadline, service authorization, appeal basis, submission receipt, and final tax outcome.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 639.87 Tm (In regulated states, partner with licensed local property-tax consultants or attorneys of record and automate) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 624.65 Tm (pre-deadline batch electronic filing through authorized channels. Keep this adjacent service outside the Base cohort) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 609.42 Tm (dollars unless the annual model explicitly replaces another revenue component.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 594.20 Tm (Treat statutory requirements as operating inputs with named evidence owners. The Highway Beautification Act, 23) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 578.97 Tm (U.S.C. 131, and 23 CFR Part 750 establish the federal outdoor advertising framework, while state programs and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 563.75 Tm (municipal rules determine the site's concrete restrictions. Federal eligibility is not a local sign permit. For IOS) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 548.52 Tm (acquisitions where all appropriate inquiries matters, 40 CFR Part 312 governs that inquiry framework; an) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 533.30 Tm (environmental professional must determine scope, timing, and any need for further investigation. A Phase I report) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 518.07 Tm (neither authorizes stormwater discharges nor resolves every operational environmental obligation. Evaluate 40 CFR) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 502.85 Tm (122.26 and the applicable state program against actual industrial activity and exposure, rather than assuming every yard) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 487.62 Tm (requires the same permit. Texas property-tax representation illustrates why the adjacent appeal service needs) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 472.40 Tm (jurisdictional routing: Occupations Code Chapter 1152 addresses property-tax consultants, and Tax Code 41.44) Tj ET
